==Trivia==
Both of this card's illustrations form a {{TCGP|narrative illustration}} with {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Trubbish|41}} and {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Phione|21}} from the same set. All of the standard illustrations in this group were first featured in the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion, and also form the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion's "Toward a More Beautiful World" [[Mega Shine (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Empoleon|35}} from the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion, as was its '''Emperor's Strike''' attack.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

